  {
   "text": "The text of the resolution on the sanctions regime in South Sudan is a technical rollover from last year.",
   "audioTimeMs": 713700,
   "emitMs": 714120,
   "isFinal": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Pakistan had abstained on the resolution last year.",
   "audioTimeMs": 717230,
   "emitMs": 717719,
   "isFinal": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Our extension today is consistent with that position.",
   "audioTimeMs": 720910,
   "emitMs": 721528,
   "isFinal": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Pakistan remains committed to lasting peace and stability in South Sudan.",
   "audioTimeMs": 725930,
   "emitMs": 726321,
   "isFinal": true
  },
  {
   "text": "We continue to support the revitalized agreement",
   "audioTimeMs": 729120,
