  {
   "text": "or punitive in nature.",
   "audioTimeMs": 745029.9700000001,
   "emitMs": 745586,
   "isFinal": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Their purpose should be to support political solutions and stabilization efforts.",
   "audioTimeMs": 749990,
   "emitMs": 750607,
   "isFinal": true
  },
  {
   "text": "We also note the African Union's position against",
